# scripts/opcount: `readerbench bench map N` reads a Map of four keys N
# times from a json.Reader on the prelude's Reader interface
# (JSON-CURSOR-ALLOC): each key the Map keeps is a copy (stdlib.md json
# 2). The control is hand Go: encoding/json into a map[string]int.
unit read
sizes 20000 120000
args bench map {n}
control benchmarks/wirereaders/testdata/control
